    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "@id": canonical + "#service",
    "serviceType": "Bosch Dishwasher Error Code Repair",
    "name": "Bosch Dishwasher Error Code Diagnostic and Repair Service",
    "url": canonical,
    "description": "Residential Bosch (and Thermador) dishwasher error code decoding and repair across all seven Southern California counties. Consumer self-help codes: E14 flow meter, E15 AquaStop leak (most common), E16/E17 inflow, E18 low fill, E22 filter/sump, E24 drain-path blockage, E25 drain-pump/cover. Technician service codes: E01 control board, E02 NTC sensor, E04 flow meter, E05 overfill, E06 door switch, E09 heater circuit. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified #1346255700410.",
