        <tr><td>Filter clean (E22 / E24 minor)</td><td>$89 diagnostic only, typically</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Drain pump (E25)</td><td>$260 to $440</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Leak repair (E15, by source)</td><td>$200 to $820</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Inlet valve (E16 / E17 / E18)</td><td>$200 to $380</td></tr>
